OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over 'horrific'
OL,4,Aattempted murder of three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 52-year-old man has been sentenced to
OL,7,Flife in prison for the attempted murder
OL,8,Fof three children outside a primary
OL,9,Fschool in Dublin's Parnell Square in
OL,10,FNovember 2023.
OL,12,FRiad Bouchaker, of no fixed address,
OL,13,Fwas also found guilty of assault
OL,14,Fcausing serious harm to creche worker
OL,15,FLeanne Flynn, and of assaulting two
OL,16,Fother children and a teenager.
OL,18,FOn Monday, Judge Tony Hunt imposed the
OL,19,Foverall sentence of life imprisonment
OL,20,Fin Dublin's Central Criminal Court.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
